<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>This table shows the <abbr title="" class="ltx_glossaryref ltx_missing">MMD</abbr> between samples from the true distribution <math id="S4.T2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{U}(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{U}(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> and those generated by the trained model.
